{
  "name": "dsh-awesome-appearances",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "DSH 界面背景主题插件（Appearance 系列，效果对齐 code-codex 原仓库）：原版全部 10 种场景渲染器（银河/辉光地平线/层峦/云穹/极光电离层/黑洞/云列车/粒子成像/像素雕塑/闪烁方块）原样 vendor、壁纸/视频素材库、通配透明 + data-slot 分区蒙版（对齐原仓库 surface-opacity）、实时预览 + 原版式场景设置抽屉（预设质量三档、每场景双语参数滑杆、五色色板、应用/重置）。深浅色自适应，设置双端同步。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "appearance",
    "background",
    "theme",
    "wallpaper",
    "desktop"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "./lib/index.js",
  "icon": "./assets/icon.svg",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "assets",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "author": "0x3F",
  "license": "MIT",
  "dsh": {
    "manifestVersion": 1,
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "pixelmatch": "^8.0.0",
    "pngjs": "^7.0.0"
  }
}
